<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/algebraic-notation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The system for recording chess moves in which each square is named by a file letter (a–h) and a rank number (1–8) from White's side, and a move is written as the piece letter plus the destination square; FIDE recognises it as the only notation for its own events." .
