<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/alpha-beta-pruning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A refinement of minimax game-tree search that skips branches which provably cannot change the value of the root, letting a chess engine reach the same result as full minimax while examining far fewer positions." .
