<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/aron-nimzowitsch> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Riga-born master and theoretician (1886–1935), regarded as the founder of the hypermodern school, author of My System (1925), and one of the world's three strongest players in the late 1920s, with tournament wins at Dresden 1926 and Carlsbad 1929." .
