<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/opposition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The endgame relationship in which the two kings stand on the same file, rank or diagonal with an odd number of squares between them; the side that does not have to move \"has the opposition\" and can force the other king to give way." .
